{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/10", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "カードは券売所配布。公式ガイド「郷土館（券売所）」、直近案内では郷土館1階券売所。旧司令長官官舎と別棟。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/11", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "市は施設配布を案内。売店内見学受付という情報はある。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/12", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "平日は南館1階。南館は本館に隣接する旧庁舎。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/13", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "平日は役場2階環境整備課、休日は役場1階宿直室。新庁舎は2021年業務開始。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/14", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "西国街道カード配布先として現在掲載、在庫あり表示。地下図中央の南北通路左、トイレ表示すぐ下の案内所区画。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/15", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "カード窓口は本館。市配置図で国道144号を下にして中央右の横長棟。左の旧市直売所・さらに左のJA直売所とは別。入口上の「ゆきむら夢工房」「観光案内所」が目印。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/16", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "園内図①は「入口ゲート＆インフォメーション」。町公式配布案内は施設名まで。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/17", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "施設公式案内に配布窓口「サイクリングセンター」と明記。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/18", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "市は道の駅配布を案内。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/19", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "窓口は「管理事務所」。施設案内は交流施設棟に事務室がある。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/2", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "土日祝の配布先として案内。徳島県資料15頁に管理棟と明記。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/20", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "第10弾カード平日配布先は処理場。土日祝は役場裏警備員室。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/21", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "副港市場1階カフェPottoでスタッフへ声掛け。運営者フロア図でも1階市場側。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/22", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "温泉側受付。町資料では温泉施設夕映と客室のある宿泊本館は別の建物区分。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/23", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "防災コミュニティセンターと旧市民サービスセンターの北部合同庁舎は別。サービスセンター2023廃止。対象カード2025-07-27配布終了。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/24", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "震災後現在窓口", "answer": "県配布案内は上下水道局1階窓口、住所は輪島市河井町21部1番地。市施設案内も同住所。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/25", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "工事中現棟", "answer": "工事中も食堂と渡り廊下でつながる物産会館内総合案内所で配布。11月2日更新案内にも配布中。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/26", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "チケット売場棟", "answer": "現市案内は南・北両チケット売場が配布先。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/3", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "中央情報交流センターではなくメインゲート前インフォメーションセンター。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/31", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "南館/本館の配置", "answer": "平日は上下水道課南館1階、警備室は本館。公式図で別館として表示。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/32", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "平日新館と休日警備員室同棟か", "answer": "企業総務課新館2階と北玄関横警備員室本館1階は別棟。通常は心のふるさと館、役所2窓口は休館日代替。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/33", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": "受付兼事務所の図上建物", "answer": "体育館横・B駐車場北の公園受付。スタジアム側公園事務所とは別。一般園内図に施設番号なし。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/4", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "府カード案内は観光案内所指定。施設公式図では国道178号側の駐車場端、トイレと同じ棟。再開後も観光案内所の営業案内あり。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/5", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "屋上公園管理人室は処理場管理棟とは別。市位置図では相模川・大津プリンスホテル側の公園端、旧テニスコート脇の小建物。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/6", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "宿日直室は第1庁舎1階「夜間休日受付」。現行フロア図では第2庁舎との連絡部分近く。新庁舎案内に「休日受付となる宿日直室」。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/7", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "市案内はカード窓口「入口受付」。寺パンフ2頁では総門を入ってすぐ左、堀の手前・トイレ横の小建物が「受付」。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/8", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "刀匠カードは「配布中止・再開未定」。現支所住所は瀬戸内市長船町土師288-1。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/issue57/human-responses.json#/responses/9", "work_unit": "issue57", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05", "question": null, "answer": "現在も「配布中止・再開未定」。2026年9月更新施設案内にも記載。", "answer_field": "answer"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/kanto-prefecture/gunma/round2-human-responses.json#/responses/1", "work_unit": "kanto-prefecture", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05T15:43:55.427340+00:00", "question": null, "answer": "はい、仮設プレハブへ移っています。   玉村町総合運動公園で休日等に配布されている群馬県流域下水道のマンホールカードについて、管理棟が長寿命化改修工事（2026年8月〜2027年2月予定）に伴い全館立入禁止となっている期間中は、窓口業務全般（利用受付・カード配布等）が管理棟前に設置された仮設プレハブ事務所に移転して運用されています。   県側の案内ページが「玉村町総合運動公園 管理棟」表記のままとなっているのは、施設名称としての主表記を維持しているためであり、現地実務としては案内どおり仮設プレハブ側の窓口で受け渡しが行われています。数値外形や訪問先ノードとしては、本設管理棟の閉鎖および仮設棟側への窓口移転と整理して問題ありません", "answer_field": "responseVerbatim"}
{"source_ref": "data/national/kanto-prefecture/gunma/round2-human-responses.json#/responses/3", "work_unit": "kanto-prefecture", "actor_type": "human", "answered_at": "2026-11-05T16:02:00.673908+00:00", "question": null, "answer": "休日カード配布も2026年8月〜2027年2月予定の工事期間は管理棟前の仮設プレハブ事務所へ移設。", "answer_field": "report"}
